    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>Di chuy\u1EC3n Nh\xE2n v\u1EADt:</color> W, A, S,
    D  |  <color=#F8DC85>Xoay Camera:</color> Di chu\u1ED9t (ho\u1EB7c gi\u1EEF Chu\u1ED9t
    Ph\u1EA3i)\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>\u0110\xE1nh th\u01B0\u1EDDng (Combo 3 nh\u1ECBp):</color>
    Chu\u1ED9t Tr\xE1i (LMB) ho\u1EB7c ph\xEDm J\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>4 K\u1EF9
    n\u0103ng Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng & Tuy\u1EC7t k\u1EF9:</color> Q, W, E v\xE0
    R (ho\u1EB7c ph\xEDm 1, 2, 3, 4)\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>N\xE9 \u0111\xF2n B\u1EA5t
    t\u1EED ng\u1EAFn (Dodge Roll):</color> Ph\xEDm Space (t\u1ED1n 25 Th\u1EC3 l\u1EF1c)\n\u2022
    <color=#F8DC85>D\xF9ng B\xECnh M\xE1u C\u1ED5 Ng\u1EEF:</color> Ph\xEDm H  | 
    <color=#F8DC85>T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c R\u01B0\u01A1ng / C\u1ED5ng / Gi\u1EA3i
    \u0111\u1ED1:</color> Ph\xEDm F\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>M\u1EDF H\u1ED3 s\u01A1
    Ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1, C\xE2y C\u1ED5 Ng\u1EEF & T\xFAi \u0111\u1ED3:</color> Ph\xEDm
    I ho\u1EB7c Tab\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>B\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3 Chi\u1EBFn thu\u1EADt
    & Nh\u1EADt k\xFD Chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u:</color> Ph\xEDm M (B\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3)
    / Ph\xEDm L (Combat Log)\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>T\u1ED5 \u0111\u1ED9i Co-op 3\u20134
    Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi:</color> K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i LAN tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp ho\u1EB7c
    s\xE1t c\xE1nh c\xF9ng AI Hunter th\xF4ng minh.\n\u2022 <color=#F8DC85>Ph\xEDm
    t\u1EAFt Ki\u1EC3m th\u1EED Nhanh trong Dungeon:</color> F5 (+1 C\u1EA5p), F6
    (R\u1EDBt \u0110\u1ED3), F7 (T\u1EDBi Ph\xF2ng Boss), F8 (D\u1ECDn Ph\xF2ng)."
